 pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.42.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Date Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">01/11/2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Wireless Receiver</b> is a logic component that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. It receives a electric signal from a <a href=\"/wiki/Wireless_Transmitter\" title=\"Wireless Transmitter\">Wireless Transmitter</a> based on its keyphrase and outputs it into a wire. \n</p><p><i>Simply said bluetooth electricity receiver.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903053841\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 140/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.540      1 Template:Logic\n100.00%   25.540      1 -total\n  7.65%    1.955      1 Template:Mainonly\n  5.02%    1.282      1 Template:Wireless_Receiver\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 